mes></name><name><surname>Preis</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>McDonald</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>Morris</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Whitelaw</surname><given-names>E</given-names></name></person-group><year>2000</year><article-title>Complex patterns of inheritance of an imprinted murine transgene suggest incomplete germline erasure.</article-title><source>Nucleic Acids Res</source><volume>28</volume><fpage>3301</fpage><lpage>3309</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">10954598</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006679-Prosch1"><label>21</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Prosch</surname><given-names>S</given-names></name><name><surname>Stein</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Staak</surname><given-names>K</given-names></name><name><surname>Liebenthal</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>Volk</surname><given-names>HD</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>1996</year><article-title>Inactivation of the very strong HCMV immediate early promoter by DNA CpG methylation in vitro.</article-title><source>Biol Chem Hoppe Seyler</source><volume>377</volume><fpage>195</fpage><lpage>201</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">8722321</pub-id></mixed-citation></ref><ref id="pone.0006679-Brooks1"><label>22</label><mixed-citation publication-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brooks</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Harkins</surname><given-names>RN</given-names></name><name><surname>Wang</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><name><surname>Qian</surname><given-names>HS</given-names></name><name><surname>Liu</surname><given-names>P</given-names></name><etal/></person-group><year>2004</year><article-title>Transcriptional silencing is associated with extensive methylation of the CMV promoter following ad